  def bnb-contexts(state, i, n, carry, trace) = i >= n ? trace : bnb-context-next(bnb-turn(bnb-session(2394, 0), state, bnb-read(), bnb-take()), i, n, carry, trace);
  def bnb-context-next(turn, i, n, carry, trace) {
